  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="Tag323" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;!--?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="no"?--&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;1. General&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Organization&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;We are a Delaware limited liability company, originally formed on November 14, 2005. When we refer to "us," "we," "our," "the Company," or "KM Illinois" we are describing Kinder Morgan Illinois Pipeline LLC. We are an indirect wholly owned subsidiary of NGPL Holdings, LLC (NGPL Holdings). Funds managed by ArcLight Capital Partners, LLC and Kinder Morgan Inc. hold a 62.5% and 37.5% interest, respectively, in NGPL Holdings.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Basis of Presentation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;We have prepared our accompanying financial statements in accordance with the accounting requirements of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission as set forth in its applicable Uniform System of Accounts and published accounting releases, which is a comprehensive basis of accounting other than accounting principles generally accepted in the United States of America (US GAAP). In management&amp;#8217;s opinion, these financial statements reflect normal and recurring adjustments that are necessary for a fair presentation of our financial results for the interim periods presented, and adequate disclosures have been made to make the information presented not misleading. These interim financial statements should be read along with the financial statements and related notes included in our 2025 Annual Report of Non-Major Natural Gas Companies on Form No. 2-A.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Management has evaluated subsequent events through August 26, 2026, the date the financial statements were available to be issued.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;2. Related Party Transactions&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Proprietary Capital&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;During the six months ended June 30, 2026, we made distributions to our Member totaling $448,000.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;During the six months ended June 30, 2025, we received capital contributions from our Member totaling $5,000 and made distributions to our Member totaling $318,000.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Affiliate Balances and Activities&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The following table summarizes our balance sheet affiliate balances (in thousands):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
